# Personal DIRECT overrides. One rule per line.
# This file is deliberately small and is the normal place for urgent additions.

# Reddit works from the user's ISP but fails through the current VPS/datacenter IP.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,reddit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redd.it
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditinc.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditmail.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditmedia.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditspace.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditstatus.com
